## Dev split

- **Babel:** agent worker, vLLM, Piper — `sync-to-babel.sh` (excludes `talkshow-web/`; default `--delete-after` prunes moved/renamed orphans; `DELETE_REMOTE=0` to keep)
- **Laptop:** `talkshow-web`, `api/tokens.py`
- Agent on Babel: sync/pull + restart worker (`.env` copied separately, not in git)

## Code style

- Minimal diff; match existing patterns in `agent/` and `talkshow-web/`.
- No commits unless the user explicitly asks.
